      "writtenOn": "2022-11-22T15:10:06Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Could this logic just go inside the if(!info.fBuffer) above? Seems like if we have to recreate the fBuffer that means we\u0027ll have to recreating the stagging buffer as well (assuming the cap check), right?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 248,
        "startChar": 3,
        "endLine": 248,
